[{"title":"百字令·曲石先生拓地筑园奉母阙太夫人，名曰阙园。为赋此解1926","author":"况周颐","text":"平泉新筑，葑葑溪奁翠，蔚然深秀。\n曾是铁翁觞咏地，近种梅花杨柳。\n息影抟鹏，雄姿射虎，未肯韶光负。\n遥山西爽，送青来照尊酒。\n佳话韦曲难方，外家腾美，绪衍齐卿旧。\n况复高堂承乐志，得似魏公眉寿。\n玉茁庭阶，花迎杖履，彩服娱春昼。\n书声琴韵，缦亭无此璈奏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5559,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"八声甘州·题林铁尊半樱簃填词图1926","author":"况周颐","text":"数词名当代一彊村，余音洗筝琶。\n更阿谁占取，暗香疏影，铁拨红牙。\n山水响来清远，吟思渺无涯。\n画罨樵歌路，和答烟霞。\n芳约瀛壖念省，道句留一半，也为樱花。\n绚春空琼树，飞梦欲随槎。\n黯笺尘、几番风雨，倚茜云、曾见夕阳斜。\n双鬟唱、画旗亭壁，珍重笼纱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5560,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆旧游·题鲍花潭中丞鸠江送别图1926","author":"况周颐","text":"问清时宦迹，老辈风流，那处停桡。\n不尽平生意，道承明著述，休要轻抛。\n办装旧日情绪，杨柳拂河桥。\n算白纻歌边，青山酒后，都是魂销。\n飘摇。\n几风雨，怕满目芜城，残墨难描。\n殿早灵光圮，共沙沈戟折，空认■朝。\n百年过客如梦，离恨付回潮。\n只数叠江峰，相逢似说人未遥。","collection":"清","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5561,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"桂枝香·又题花潭中丞诒经书屋冬日课孙图1926","author":"况周颐","text":"菟裘小筑。\n理旧业讲筵，人是名宿。\n■得清芬阅世，老怀差足。\n年时点颔浑如昨，几星霜、崭然头角。\n尔曹知否。\n休耽渴睡，漫夸便腹。\n任省识、冬烘面目。\n念经授瑶宫，晖映天禄。\n台省回翔卅载，隙驹何速。\n工诗早已■贻厥，况■笛、清绝尘俗。\n古芸凝处。\n家风无改，故山高躅。","collection":"清","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5562,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪沙","author":"况周颐","text":"莫遣歌尘到扇边。\n苕华珍重绿琅玕。\n篁溪高矩至今传。\n画铁凝姿成幻渺，镌筠著骨见芳坚。\n笑他刻楮几经年。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5563,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪沙","author":"况周颐","text":"冰样词人天样遥。\n翠衾贪度可怜宵。\n未应笺管换钗翘。\n破面春风防粉爪，画眉新月恋香豪。\n柳颦花笑奈明朝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5564,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"东风第一枝","author":"况周颐","text":"寒重花慵，灯疏漏短，清吟谁伴孤影。\n故人却共春来，倦灯暂销夜冷。\n天涯旧梦，又盝曲、红阑催暝。\n对玉梅、证取心期，早是宿酲轻醒。\n檠凤短、茜纱方静。\n筝雁悄、素弦待整。\n彩毫怯写银笺，暗香尚留宝鼎。\n鸾箫凤籥，看次第、天风吹并。\n怕俊游、不似年时，负了武陵渔艇。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5565,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"大酺","author":"况周颐","text":"又海棠收，荼蘼过，芳事难留华屋。\n红扶灯畔影，话丰台消息，旧游枨触。\n锦幄香融，玉柈粉晕，吟赏消他丝竹。\n遽怜春婪尾，倚娇憨莫负，绿醪初熟。\n记冻彻铜瓶，闭门前度，咏梅人独。\n番风过迅速。\n几回见、蜂蝶随雕毂。\n未用说、清吟洛下，影事扬州，便一枝、尽供题目。\n十载东华梦，空怅惘、艳翻阶曲。\n将离恨，黯京国。\n多少铅泪，襟上猩红如菽。\n岁华黯惊转烛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5566,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"采绿吟","author":"况周颐","text":"小苑槐风静，倦听蜀魄林西。\n余英湛水，纹纱换影，凉意生诗。\n梦回香篆里，浑难辨、曲屏几摺琉璃。\n似年时，湖山路，垂杨烟艇舣谁。\n清露滴阑干，湘弦润，新声知更幽脆。\n隔断软红尘，认一桁帘衣。\n昼愔愔、犹剩春寒，莓墙暗、慵觅旧时题。\n闲凝伫、芳树远天，烟外径微。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5567,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"莺啼序","author":"况周颐","text":"时晴峭寒共忍，镇商量酒户。\n况清绝、眉月窥帘，玉梅相对愁暮。\n怨襟共、山屏翠浅，消魂客似长亭树。\n蓦飘灯丛玉，鸣窗旧欢重絮。\n黯说巴山，话雨夜短，堕篷窗浅雾。\n又京国、鸣筑搊筝，绮情题满缣素。\n刬前尘、鬘天杏约，忍偷换、垂杨金缕。\n暝堤空，移缆江梅，暗惊眠鹭。\n西鹣牒在，北雁书沉，有情枉倦旅。\n顿悟澈、鬓丝金镜，靓影鸾悄，剑摄痴虹，榻迷花雨。\n华年锦瑟，黄尘乌帽，沾巾同下新亭泣，待孤帆、晚截金焦渡。\n抟沙几辈，羁游荷锸江皋，世外甚处閒土。\n风?飐夕，画舸乘秋，有艳歌白苎。\n恰镌琬、离妆晨检，小印泥封，砚鹆慵揩，渚鸿低舞。\n琼箫倚凤，铜槃消蜡，人生安得无聚散，漫骊歌、调损鹍弦柱。\n分笺凭讯词仙，帽影邗江，半塘健否。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5568,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆江南","author":"许禧身","text":"儿时忆，结伴戏中庭。\n自埽落花惊粉蝶，还抛梅子打黄莺。\n雨洒竹梢青。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5569,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆江南","author":"许禧身","text":"儿时忆，纨扇乍秋凉。\n喜与雏鬟掏蟋蟀，爱同小友捉迷藏。\n花底月昏黄。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5570,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆江南","author":"许禧身","text":"儿时忆，瓜果设云屏。\n青玉案前同乞巧，水晶帘下共穿针。\n脉脉拜双星。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5571,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆江南","author":"许禧身","text":"儿时忆，春日永慈闱。\n每作娇痴依母膝，偶思问字揽儿衣。\n色笑总无违。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5572,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆江南","author":"许禧身","text":"儿时忆，傍屋画桥横。\n两岸垂杨千缕碧，一湾流水片帆轻。\n花发近清明。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5573,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆江南","author":"许禧身","text":"儿时忆，琐事不关心。\n姊妹闺中同刺绣，弟兄书屋共联吟。\n灯火夜沈沈。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5574,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆江南","author":"许禧身","text":"儿时忆，风景爱清华。\n度曲不妨惊睡鹤，敲棋那管落灯花。\n窗外月光斜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5575,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆江南","author":"许禧身","text":"儿时忆，爆竹换年光。\n春酒筵开同献寿，椒花酿就共飞觞。\n舞彩奉萱堂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5576,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆江南","author":"许禧身","text":"儿时忆，春暖报花开。\n剪就彩旂黏树杪，散将佳种傍亭台。\n处处手亲栽。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5577,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆江南","author":"许禧身","text":"儿时忆，佳节已端阳。\n折得榴花簪短鬓，采来蒲艾缚匡床。\n函夏日方长。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5578,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆江南","author":"许禧身","text":"儿时忆，姑嫂学挑丝。\n每绣鸳鸯藏叶底，常描蛱蝶恋花枝。\n帘卷夕阳时。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5579,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆江南","author":"许禧身","text":"儿时忆，韵事属香闺。\n丹桂庭中初擪笛，碧梧院落听调丝。\n忘却月痕迟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5580,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆江南·咏西湖","author":"许禧身","text":"江南忆，最忆圣湖庄。\n一色波光飞白鹭，数湾流水宿鸳鸯。\n西岭已斜阳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5581,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆江南","author":"许禧身","text":"江南忆，最忆是孤山。\n几树红梅和月澹，数丛翠竹入云閒。\n暮色水光寒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5582,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆江南","author":"许禧身","text":"江南忆，最忆是湖亭。\n四面红栏花印月，一池碧水露涵萍。\n钟韵静中听。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5583,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆江南","author":"许禧身","text":"江南忆，最忆是山庄。\n觅得小舟游曲径，登将高阁俯芳塘。\n花木绕长廊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5584,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆江南·咏淮园","author":"许禧身","text":"名园好，最好是回廊。\n一带朱藤盘曲折，两行桂树吐芬芳。\n风送笛声扬。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5585,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆江南","author":"许禧身","text":"名园好，最好是波光。\n俯视池鱼吹细浪，仰观飞鸟带斜阳。\n阵阵送荷香。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5586,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆江南","author":"许禧身","text":"名园好，最爱夜来时。\n花色满园风弄竹，波光小艇月催诗。\n遥听漏迟迟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5587,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮·深夜闻雁","author":"许禧身","text":"霞光一片花如锦。\n兰闺独坐香醪饮。\n连日兴阑珊。\n蕉窗画牡丹。\n茶香灯下品。\n睡后还欹枕。\n惊破梦惺忪。\n遥天归暮鸿。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5588,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"卖花声·月夜闻歌","author":"许禧身","text":"风静夜泠泠。\n何处箫声。\n听来历历韵分明。\n最妙一枝斑竹好，入耳偏清。\n衙鼓点轻轻。\n已报初更。\n露华如水洗中庭。\n且喜窗前明月满，背了红灯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5589,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"高阳台·感怀","author":"许禧身","text":"漫点铜龙，缓敲檐铁，欣闻春雨纷纷。\n笼雾青纱，照来烛影偏清。\n隔闱共说安民语，喜听来、句句真诚。\n黯消凝。\n炉内香残，案上灯昏。\n运筹决尽承平策，奈安边少计，鬓角愁生。\n一样无眠，静传银箭沈沈。\n祝天早罢干戈事，愿从今、永庆升平。\n倚窗听。\n残溜声低，滴至黎明。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5590,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"点绛唇·咏清宴园","author":"许禧身","text":"閒倚西楼，声声箫鼓吹来早。\n旌旗树杪。\n一片霞光照。\n池外红桥，桥外青松绕。\n天初晓。\n日光皎皎。\n花闹多青草。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5591,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"醉太平·其二","author":"许禧身","text":"花光露光。\n荷香桂香。\n清风拂拂生凉。\n有文禽一双。\n桥南画堂。\n桥西碧窗。\n柳阴掩隐红墙。\n看珠帘绕廊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5592,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"醉花阴·月夜即事","author":"许禧身","text":"月光澹澹花影瘦。\n窗下清风透。\n漏鼓绕围墙，薄薄纱幮，夜静凉时候。\n红闺娇女燃金兽。\n曲谱新排就。\n罗袖韵珊珊，灯下欣欣，还把诗牌斗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5593,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"长相思·春江野泊","author":"许禧身","text":"风潇潇。\n雨潇潇。\n红杏林中酒旆招。\n杨花随地飘。\n山遥遥。\n水遥遥。\n牛背村童过小桥。\n数声长笛高。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5594,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"高阳台·病中咏梅有感","author":"许禧身","text":"蕴玉藏珠，发丹吐蕊，开来密密琼柯。\n疏影横斜，费人几度吟哦。\n任他异样严风逼，耐冰霜、雅意婆娑。\n奈春何。\n暖到庭阶，万木生和。\n兼句小病难抛却，叹朝光零落，黯自消磨。\n长夜无眠，寒香悄引诗魔。\n青灯一豆残烟尽，乍朦胧、梦也无多。\n听檐阿。\n铁马徐鸣，晓雁初过。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5595,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"风蝶令","author":"许禧身","text":"瑶岛回环处，神仙缥缈中。\n碧琉璃瓦殿玲珑。\n却见许多仙子聚重重。\n队结湘娥侣，班随玉女丛。\n可知阿父隐帘栊。\n赢得唾冰红化泪中浓。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5596,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"风蝶令","author":"许禧身","text":"水绕重栏曲，烟笼翠嶂匀。\n携来素手意温存。\n不道天凡境隔尚相亲。\n灵鹊填桥急，银河唤渡频。\n红闺旧侣漫逡巡。\n记取五云深处是仙村。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5597,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"风蝶令","author":"许禧身","text":"洗尽闺娃态，全非粉黛妆。\n金冠覆额体矜庄。\n手执琼箫归侍绣帏旁。\n桐叶惊宵落，莲花滴漏长。\n月移竹影过西窗。\n不觉惊回残梦断柔肠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5598,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"风蝶令","author":"许禧身","text":"璀璨金坊立，低徊玉砌幽。\n凌虚罗袜下瀛洲。\n认取琪花瑶草满阶头。\n宛转通情话，丁宁慰母愁。\n忽闻广乐韵悠悠。\n便送一瓯仙露促归舟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5599,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"一剪梅","author":"许禧身","text":"穗帐空悬影渺茫。\n月到西廊。\n风弄西窗。\n来从何处去何方。\n母也心伤。\n儿也心伤。\n翠袖低垂振佩档。\n泪滴云裳。\n悲结衷肠。\n丰姿明媚旧时装。\n云气飞扬。\n雾气飞扬。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5600,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮","author":"许禧身","text":"方塘曲水清如许。\n莲花五色知何处。\n遥听梵音清。\n虹桥一道平。\n山头云缥缈。\n翠柏苍松老。\n失足蓦然惊。\n梦回刚五更。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5601,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浪淘沙","author":"许禧身","text":"小立对瑶窗。\n懒剔银缸。\n掉头怕见泪珠双。\n玉带锦衣刚入梦，报晓钟撞。\n忽弃旧时裳。\n环佩铮鏦。\n云车风马下吴江。\n花落花开儿不管，一道红墙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5602,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮","author":"许禧身","text":"绣旗天半朱霞卷。\n馥馥香风吹不断。\n秋水证禅心。\n禅关花木深。\n瓶钵生涯外。\n齐向瑶阶拜。\n怜尔法门僧。\n佛前传一灯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5603,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮","author":"许禧身","text":"修篁风动敲青玉。\n瑶台合驻天孙躅。\n秀色宛如生。\n人来漫送迎。\n纤纤扬素手。\n满室香盈袖。\n含笑且沈吟。\n似闻环佩声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5604,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮","author":"许禧身","text":"绛云拥座神威肃。\n霜矛列侍旌旗簇。\n洗尽女儿妆。\n凌霄意态扬。\n将军齐拱手。\n帐下供奔走。\n霞彩满天生。\n为君定太平。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5605,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"鹧鸪天","author":"许禧身","text":"倦倚藤床若有思。\n手持一卷步迟迟。\n金冠覆额长眉妩，玉笛横腰半面窥。\n登翠辇，拂云帔。\n遥观只见彩丝丝。\n梦中正在惊猜处，一片灵旂拥护辞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5606,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"卜算子","author":"许禧身","text":"帆影漾波光，梦幻江心月。\n喁喁絮语兰闺事，两下无休歇。\n昔日两知心，今日扁舟别。\n惟有慈乌反哺心，终久难抛绝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5607,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"卜算子","author":"许禧身","text":"玉井莫轻投，衣被香风袭。\n就中忽见卷珠帘，不觉轻身入。\n仙子坐瑶台，素手亲拈笔。\n宫扇双分广乐鸣，书寄慈帏侧。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5608,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"一剪梅","author":"许禧身","text":"风风雨雨近重阳。\n忆女情长。\n爱女情长。\n朦胧恍入黑甜乡。\n云绕前廊。\n月绕前廊。\n连枝忽睹入华堂。\n称体宫装。\n适体仙装。\n摩挲老眼认难详。\n悲惹衷肠。\n愁惹衷肠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5609,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行香子","author":"许禧身","text":"月冷三更。\n梦冷三更。\n蓦香车绣幰相迎。\n一泓清浅，已到蓬瀛。\n话儿时事，病时语，别时情。\n床帏织锦，楼观飞琼。\n殷勤奉母黯吞声。\n人天一别，返哺乌鸣。\n愿椿长茂，萱长寿，棣长荣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5610,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浪淘沙","author":"许禧身","text":"楼阁五云中。\n七宝玲珑。\n重归天上不相同。\n忽忆外家诸女伴，絮语东风。\n瑶草玉阶红。\n一道垂虹。\n漫山翠柏閒丹枫。\n旧日人閒鸡与犬，谢却樊笼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5611,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮","author":"许禧身","text":"珠宫竞奏霓裳曲。\n翩翩舞态人如玉。\n檀板拍红牙。\n仙源正著花。\n千枝华烛朗。\n露气宵来爽。\n双手捧琼浆。\n萱闱且解伤。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5612,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"虞美人","author":"许禧身","text":"孝娥黯护长途里。\n不减生前意。\n云车风马过空中。\n却值珊珊候舅暂相逢。\n梦归琐琐言之细。\n醒后还堪记。\n或因访友泰山来。\n顷刻一帆平静海波开。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5613,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"声声慢","author":"许禧身","text":"冰簟炎多，纱闱睡少，宵深听尽更更。\n双桂楼前，露珠点滴无声。\n帏前一灯岑寂，听桐阴、瑟瑟风轻。\n朦胧里，见亭亭玉立，莲面如生。\n恍若烟云围绕，看霞光焕发，欲认难清。\n秀慧丰姿，观来绰约神莹。\n机梭往回抛处，有天孙、彩结晶瑛。\n鸦报晓，夜将阑月半明。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5614,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮·清明梦先母与女，思乡感作","author":"许禧身","text":"春风吹得春愁重。\n宵来魂绕梨云梦。\n默想总迷离。\n牵衣膝下依。\n桃红杨柳绿。\n自觉归心促。\n何事更停留。\n扁舟冷陌头。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5615,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮","author":"许禧身","text":"四围春色光如织。\n绿茵满目山生碧。\n归念上心头。\n凭阑蝶桂楼。\n乡思何日了。\n更惧春寒峭。\n抛去又重来。\n双眉总未开。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5616,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮","author":"许禧身","text":"年来种种閒情澹。\n落红满砌花光暂。\n飘泊惜残枝。\n黄莺知不知。\n故园春已足。\n何日还乡国。\n望尽白云边。\n魂飞路几千。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5617,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮","author":"许禧身","text":"宦情总为绳牵住。\n何时再整归舟路。\n柳色满江春。\n遥听唤渡人。\n右台云气绕。\n孤负山光好。\n只觉系人愁。\n归鸦啼不休。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5618,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"金缕曲·独坐无聊，忽见蜘蛛一丝微吐，满屋旋转，戏作","author":"许禧身","text":"行是腾云软。\n只空中、一丝微吐，飘扬轻转。\n八足交叉形似舞，彷佛无肠影幻。\n更密密、檐前布满。\n地网天罗重更叠，叹飞虫、啖尽无从算。\n丛叶底，惯牵绊。\n千丝结后终难断。\n但看他、蜂藏蝶敛，纷纷避远。\n日月精华良夜足，更喜春风和暖。\n却只恨、禽声啼乱。\n弱絮飞花随意罥，最玲珑、雨落成珠串。\n芳讯报，桂楼畔。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5619,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"风蝶令·游墩子河","author":"许禧身","text":"流水波如镜，长空云是罗。\n双双燕剪点轻波，只少隔江高唱采莲歌。\n且向堤头坐，轻风拂体和。\n一腔幽恨叹如何。\n却好仙香吹得满襟多。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5620,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"苏幕遮·感怀","author":"许禧身","text":"恨丝丝，情缕缕。\n如此心肠，却向谁人语。\n泪痕恰是春朝雨。\n欲把悲肠，抛去偏难去。\n絮庭寒，莲漏数。\n一片冰轮，怎解侬心苦。\n欲乞姮娥相代诉。\n何日飞升，得返瑶台住。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5621,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]